$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Dimethyl
2'-hydroxy-5'-(4-(methoxycarbonyl)phenyl)-[1,1':3',1''-terphenyl]-4,4''-dicarboxylate
(3). A mixture of 2,4,6-tribromophenol (S4, 3 g, 9.06 mmol),
(4-(methoxycarbonyl)phenyl)boronic acid (S3, 14.6 g, 91.1 mmol), Na2CO3
(6.7 g, 63.2 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (200 mg, 5 mol%) were dissolved in distilled
water (100 mL) and degassed DMF (100 mL), and heated to 60 °C overnight
under nitrogen atmosphere. Afterwards, the reaction mixture was poured
into water, and pH value was adjusted to ~ 5. The resulting crude was
filtered and washed with water. The crude product was purified by flash
column chromatography on silica gel using progressively more polar to 1:1
mixture of hexanes : EtOAc as the mobile phase. 3 as a pale pink solid
(3.6 g, 80%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 8.17 (d, 4H), 8.10 (d, 2H),
7.68 (m, 6H), 7.59 (s, 2H), 3.95 (s, 9H).
